# The rewrite writes its rewritten bodies without an envelope, so the copy
# loses the stamp the rewrite promised (the #5243 defect for a transform).
MODULE: IntendedContributionRewriteDropsEnvelope
TARGET: IntendedContribution
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the rewrite stores un-enveloped bodies
PERTURBS: BuildRewrite

--- FIND
               /\ stored' = [stored EXCEPT ![2] = [k \in Keys |-> Rewritten(stored[1][k], at)]]
--- REPLACE
               /\ stored' = [stored EXCEPT ![2] = [k \in Keys |->
                    [ver |-> 0, body |-> Rewritten(stored[1][k], at).body]]]
--- END
